
     The prerequisites for writing a multi-user
program are:

     C - The C programming language.
         A good reference book on C is "The C Programming
         Language" by Kernighan & Ritche, Prentice-Hall 
         Press, 1978.  $7.95
         ISBN 0-13-110163-3

     Unix - The UNIX operating system.
         A good reference book on UNIX is "The UNIX Programming
         Environment" by Kernighan.  Prentice-Hall Press,
         1979.  $12.95

     Any bookstore with a decent supply of computer books
will have the two listed above, or something similiar.

     Buy them!!
